  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "3D動畫實作與歷史建物永續II",
    "sub_ename": "IMPLEMENTATION OF 3D VIRTUAL REALITY AND THE SUSTAINABILITY OF HISTORICAL BUILDINGS (II)",
    "describe_ch": "想法和理念的傳導需要透過方便且清楚的工具作為管道。本課程的前半將透過設計網頁UI的方式，以做出具備RWD功能的網頁為載體，透過歷史或知名建物各面向的3D圖說為介紹內容，並且讓同學嘗試在作品中以自我的觀點對該建物的未來做出闡述；課程的後半將以不特定建物格局為基底，透過各空間中家具的繪製教學，讓同學可以更加務實且嫻熟的應用3D虛擬空間及工具，並將其應用在自己的現實生活之中。",
    "describe_eh": "It's essential to convey concepts and ideas by a handy tool. In the first part, this course will lead students to design user interfaces, and make a responsive website with responsive web design (RWD). Through displaying 3D model of the historic or famous buildings, students will learn to express their opinions of the future of buildings. In the final part, this course will lead students to design house layouts with furniture. Students will become more adept in 3D virtual reality, and apply it to the real life.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解歷史及知名建物，並透過網頁設計方式，學習如何將構思或想傳達的內容做呈現。",
      "describe_en": "Realize the history of the famous buildings. Through website design, learn how to express ideas."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學習3D繪製及培養空間感，透過實作讓抽象想法具備呈現的能力。",
      "describe_en": "Learn how to build 3D models and have a better sense of spacing. Cultivate students' the ability of making an idea to the implementation."
    }
  ],
